odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6168:A)The <office:document> 3.1.2 element shall have an office:mimetype 3.1.2 attribute with one of these values: "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text", "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-template", "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master" or "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master-template". 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:6170:B)If the document is an OpenDocument package then it shall contain a file named mimetype containing one of these strings: "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text", "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-template", "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master" or "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master-template". 
